silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_03_negative_regression_catalog_concrete_anchor_3#tsn183798node silm:hasLongDescription "The TSN183798Node is The taxon identifier TSN 183798 — a numeric identifier in the ITIS taxonomy database. This is a node of type TaxonIdentifier, not of type Individual. Regression k2 blocks TSN 183798 → Mittens directly. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TaxonIdentifier', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
